<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Elegance Intl shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Elegance Intl shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of eyeglass frame maker Elegance International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
</text>
